{
  "id": "ch02_s24_shuge",
  "chapter": 2,
  "act": 2,
  "scene": "shuge",
  "palette": "ink",
  "cast": [
    "wuze",
    "liqinghe"
  ],
  "weightless": false,
  "leavesLetter": [
    "liqinghe"
  ],
  "purpose": "公主交出会失支持的财政稿，也问一次完全私人的相见",
  "lines": [
    {
      "id": "ch02_s24_shuge.l1",
      "who": "narr",
      "kind": "aside",
      "text": "公主的全稿已送到书阁，李令仪随后进门。"
    },
    {
      "id": "ch02_s24_shuge.l2",
      "who": "narr",
      "kind": "aside",
      "text": "灯只点一盏。李令仪先放下厚稿，又放下一页撤署。"
    },
    {
      "id": "ch02_s24_shuge.l3",
      "who": "liqinghe",
      "expr": "default",
      "kind": "say",
      "text": "全稿，末页也在。"
    },
    {
      "id": "ch02_s24_shuge.l4",
      "who": "wuze",
      "expr": "default",
      "kind": "say",
      "text": "末页。"
    },
    {
      "id": "ch02_s24_shuge.l5",
      "who": "wuze",
      "expr": "default",
      "kind": "say",
      "text": "从你的旧供给里减？"
    },
    {
      "id": "ch02_s24_shuge.l6",
      "who": "liqinghe",
      "expr": "default",
      "kind": "say",
      "text": "是，腾来付远处的寄卷与核验。"
    },
    {
      "id": "ch02_s24_shuge.l7",
      "who": "wuze",
      "expr": "default",
      "kind": "say",
      "text": "她原来署过名。"
    },
    {
      "id": "ch02_s24_shuge.l8",
      "who": "liqinghe",
      "expr": "default",
      "kind": "say",
      "text": "原来。"
    },
    {
      "id": "ch02_s24_shuge.l9",
      "who": "liqinghe",
      "expr": "guarded",
      "kind": "say",
      "text": "如今不荐我了。"
    },
    {
      "id": "ch02_s24_shuge.l10",
      "who": "wuze",
      "expr": "guarded",
      "kind": "say",
      "text": "不荐了……"
    },
    {
      "id": "ch02_s24_shuge.l11",
      "who": "narr",
      "kind": "aside",
      "text": "李令仪沿着撤署的折痕压了一遍，手指没有越过原名。"
    },
    {
      "id": "ch02_s24_shuge.l12",
      "who": "liqinghe",
      "expr": "guarded",
      "kind": "say",
      "text": "从我小时就替我收账，今日却叫我不必再拿。"
    },
    {
      "id": "ch02_s24_shuge.l13",
      "who": "wuze",
      "expr": "guarded",
      "kind": "say",
      "text": "……"
    },
    {
      "id": "ch02_s24_shuge.l14",
      "who": "wuze",
      "expr": "default",
      "kind": "say",
      "text": "想拿回去改么？"
    },
    {
      "id": "ch02_s24_shuge.l15",
      "who": "liqinghe",
      "expr": "default",
      "kind": "say",
      "text": "想过，改这一笔，另一边的钱就没来处。"
    },
    {
      "id": "ch02_s24_shuge.l16",
      "who": "wuze",
      "expr": "default",
      "kind": "say",
      "text": "可我不会——"
    },
    {
      "id": "ch02_s24_shuge.l17",
      "who": "liqinghe",
      "expr": "default",
      "kind": "say",
      "text": "所以给你。"
    },
    {
      "id": "ch02_s24_shuge.l18",
      "who": "wuze",
      "expr": "default",
      "kind": "say",
      "text": "……"
    },
    {
      "id": "ch02_s24_shuge.l19",
      "who": "liqinghe",
      "expr": "default",
      "kind": "say",
      "text": "撤署那页也在，明日照样驳。"
    },
    {
      "id": "ch02_s24_shuge.l20",
      "who": "narr",
      "kind": "aside",
      "text": "她把手收回去，没有把稿换成更薄的一摞。"
    },
    {
      "id": "ch02_s24_shuge.l21",
      "who": "liqinghe",
      "expr": "default",
      "kind": "say",
      "text": "还有一件。"
    },
    {
      "id": "ch02_s24_shuge.l22",
      "who": "wuze",
      "expr": "default",
      "kind": "say",
      "text": "你说。"
    },
    {
      "id": "ch02_s24_shuge.l23",
      "who": "wuze",
      "expr": "default",
      "kind": "say",
      "text": "也是明日？"
    },
    {
      "id": "ch02_s24_shuge.l24",
      "who": "liqinghe",
      "expr": "default",
      "kind": "say",
      "text": "不是。"
    },
    {
      "id": "ch02_s24_shuge.l25",
      "who": "liqinghe",
      "expr": "open",
      "kind": "say",
      "text": "今夜想见你。"
    },
    {
      "id": "ch02_s24_shuge.l26",
      "who": "wuze",
      "expr": "default",
      "kind": "say",
      "text": "已经见了。"
    },
    {
      "id": "ch02_s24_shuge.l27",
      "who": "liqinghe",
      "expr": "open",
      "kind": "say",
      "text": "方才是来递稿，交完了，想再留一会儿。"
    },
    {
      "id": "ch02_s24_shuge.l28",
      "who": "wuze",
      "expr": "open",
      "kind": "say",
      "text": "一会儿……"
    },
    {
      "id": "ch02_s24_shuge.l29",
      "who": "liqinghe",
      "expr": "open",
      "kind": "say",
      "text": "只等你答这句。"
    },
    {
      "id": "ch02_s24_shuge.l30",
      "who": "self",
      "kind": "inner",
      "text": "（她没有拿起那一页。是真的在等。）"
    },
    {
      "id": "ch02_s24_shuge.l31",
      "when": {
        "flag.liqinghe_public_only": true
      },
      "who": "liqinghe",
      "expr": "default",
      "kind": "say",
      "text": "先前只约公事，今日仍可这样答。"
    },
    {
      "id": "ch02_s24_shuge.l32",
      "when": {
        "flag.liqinghe_public_only": true
      },
      "who": "wuze",
      "expr": "default",
      "kind": "say",
      "text": "公事。"
    },
    {
      "id": "ch02_s24_shuge.l33",
      "when": {
        "flag.liqinghe_keep_both_drafts": true
      },
      "who": "liqinghe",
      "expr": "default",
      "kind": "say",
      "text": "两份原稿都留，私话不替公议改字。"
    },
    {
      "id": "ch02_s24_shuge.l34",
      "when": {
        "flag.liqinghe_keep_both_drafts": true
      },
      "who": "wuze",
      "expr": "default",
      "kind": "say",
      "text": "都留。"
    },
    {
      "id": "ch02_s24_shuge.l35",
      "when": {
        "flag.liqinghe_affection_with_dissent": true
      },
      "who": "liqinghe",
      "expr": "default",
      "kind": "say",
      "text": "喜欢也仍要驳我，你信里这两句我都记着。"
    },
    {
      "id": "ch02_s24_shuge.l36",
      "when": {
        "flag.liqinghe_affection_with_dissent": true
      },
      "who": "wuze",
      "expr": "default",
      "kind": "say",
      "text": "两句。"
    },
    {
      "id": "ch02_s24_shuge.l37",
      "when": {
        "flag.silent_to_liqinghe": true
      },
      "who": "liqinghe",
      "expr": "default",
      "kind": "say",
      "text": "上封不必补答，今日照今日的心意。"
    },
    {
      "id": "ch02_s24_shuge.l38",
      "when": {
        "flag.silent_to_liqinghe": true
      },
      "who": "wuze",
      "expr": "default",
      "kind": "say",
      "text": "今日。"
    },
    {
      "id": "ch02_s24_shuge.l39",
      "who": "narr",
      "kind": "aside",
      "text": "她移开袖边的稿，露出半张席，却没有径自坐下。"
    },
    {
      "id": "ch02_s24_shuge.l40",
      "who": "liqinghe",
      "expr": "default",
      "kind": "say",
      "text": "不留我就走，明日不会因此少给你看一页。"
    },
    {
      "id": "ch02_s24_shuge.l41",
      "who": "narr",
      "kind": "aside",
      "text": "李将全稿留在书阁的案上，等你答今夜。"
    }
  ],
  "chapterEnd": true,
  "choices": [
    {
      "id": "ch02_s24_shuge.cA",
      "text": "留一会儿。明日我仍会驳你",
      "effects": {
        "flag.li_ch02_private_yes": true
      },
      "irreversible": false
    },
    {
      "id": "ch02_s24_shuge.cB",
      "text": "今夜想独处，改日再问",
      "effects": {
        "flag.li_ch02_private_wait": true
      },
      "irreversible": false
    },
    {
      "id": "ch02_s24_shuge.cC",
      "text": "我只约你明日论议",
      "effects": {
        "flag.li_ch02_private_no": true
      },
      "irreversible": false
    }
  ],
  "goto": "ch03_s01_shuge"
}
